+# Spinner
+
+`Spinner` is a component that notify users that their action is being processed.
+
+## Usage
+
+```jsx
+import { Spinner } from '@wp-g2/components/ui';
+
+function Example() {
+	return <Spinner />;
+}
+```
+
+## Props
+
+##### color
+
+**Type**: `CSSProperties['color']`
+
+The color of the `Spinner`.
+
+##### size
+
+**Type**: `number`
+
+The size of the `Spinner`.
